WEBVTT

00:42.584 --> 00:43.668
Where do I begin?

00:45.086 --> 00:47.505
First, I'll tell you about myself.

00:47.589 --> 00:49.382
We have no time. Let's hurry.

00:51.217 --> 00:52.343
Here.

00:52.427 --> 00:53.511
What's next?

00:53.595 --> 00:55.805
I live a very professional life.

00:55.889 --> 00:57.265
- Pose for us.
- You're pretty.

00:57.348 --> 00:58.308
- Over here.
- Good.

00:58.391 --> 00:59.684
Pose for us.

00:59.768 --> 01:01.352
- Over here.
- You're amazing.

01:01.436 --> 01:02.479
Look over here.

01:02.562 --> 01:03.688
Look up, please.

01:03.772 --> 01:05.231
My life is glamorous

01:06.316 --> 01:08.318
and way too passionate.

01:10.028 --> 01:11.362
But enough about that.

01:12.363 --> 01:14.157
I'll tell you about my true self.

01:20.538 --> 01:21.706
SHINE LIKE MAGIC

01:30.173 --> 01:32.801
There's this character in my story.

01:36.930 --> 01:39.724
He appeared out of nowhere one day
as if he was destined to.

01:41.726 --> 01:43.186
But not really.

01:49.484 --> 01:50.401
NJ

01:51.611 --> 01:52.987
NJ PURCHASES A FIVE-STORY BUILDING

01:53.071 --> 01:55.907
News like this travels fast.

01:55.990 --> 01:56.991
Celebrities make easy money.

01:57.075 --> 01:58.827
I hear she became an idol
just to buy buildings.

01:58.910 --> 02:02.080
Is it an article about you?
Whatever it is, don't look at it for now.

02:02.163 --> 02:04.874
That's easier said than done.

02:05.458 --> 02:08.253
There are so many ads
in news articles nowadays.

02:08.837 --> 02:09.796
Gosh.

02:10.380 --> 02:11.923
Darn it.

02:12.590 --> 02:15.802
I guess we were scientifically matched
through big data analysis.

02:16.803 --> 02:18.054
These drawings are a bit…

02:18.138 --> 02:20.765
GO-OH

02:21.474 --> 02:23.017
…strange.

02:23.101 --> 02:23.935
GO-OH'S ILLUSTRATIONS

02:24.018 --> 02:27.021
After purchasing a building,

02:27.105 --> 02:30.400
I ended up going to an exhibition
of someone who only drew buildings.

02:32.152 --> 02:34.028
And that's where we met.

02:36.447 --> 02:39.492
It may be crinkled, but it's clean.

02:41.369 --> 02:42.954
What's this for?

02:43.037 --> 02:44.414
You're crying.

02:51.754 --> 02:54.048
This place might be confusing to navigate.

02:54.132 --> 02:56.009
You can start over there.

03:05.977 --> 03:07.228
Thank you.

03:09.355 --> 03:10.815
Don't I look silly?

03:12.233 --> 03:15.028
I'm crying while
looking at a drawing of a building.

03:16.487 --> 03:17.739
It's understandable.

03:18.323 --> 03:20.074
Did this drawing make you cry too?

03:20.992 --> 03:22.160
Well…

03:23.244 --> 03:24.495
I knew it.

03:25.622 --> 03:27.498
I'm the only one who's a mess.

03:30.126 --> 03:31.085
Well…

03:32.670 --> 03:35.882
Feel free to come here and cry
whenever you want.

03:37.175 --> 03:39.636
If you're too embarrassed,
I'll cry with you.

03:45.558 --> 03:47.644
That was such a cheesy pick-up line.

03:48.311 --> 03:49.771
I was trying to comfort you.

03:49.854 --> 03:52.190
Why would you comfort a stranger?

03:52.273 --> 03:56.527
You don't feel like a stranger to me
since I've seen you often on TV.

03:56.611 --> 03:58.738
I feel like I know you.

03:58.821 --> 04:00.156
I'm a fan of yours, NJ.

04:01.449 --> 04:03.284
Hey!

04:08.289 --> 04:09.290
Hey…

04:10.375 --> 04:12.877
Hey, where are you?

04:12.961 --> 04:14.337
Hey.

04:14.420 --> 04:17.131
When I find something suspicious,
I have to get to the bottom of it.

04:17.215 --> 04:18.258
Do you work here?

04:19.300 --> 04:21.344
No. I'm a visitor.

04:21.427 --> 04:23.304
Do you know the artist?

04:23.388 --> 04:25.014
No. I'm just a visitor.

04:25.098 --> 04:27.392
I'd like to buy this one. How much is it?

04:27.475 --> 04:28.601
It's ten million…

04:31.020 --> 04:33.106
Since I'm a mere visitor, I'm not sure.

04:33.189 --> 04:34.691
But you can go ask over there.

04:34.774 --> 04:36.776
The drawings aren't the only things
that are strange.

04:37.360 --> 04:38.361
- Sorry?
- Sorry?

04:39.028 --> 04:41.698
Never mind. Where do I need to go again?

04:42.282 --> 04:45.159
Please don't damage it.
Please be careful with it.

04:45.243 --> 04:48.496
GO-OH'S SOLO EXHIBITION

04:48.579 --> 04:51.666
So I wanted to find out.

04:51.749 --> 04:53.209
Give me your phone.

04:53.293 --> 04:55.295
- I am a busy woman, but…
- What for?

04:55.378 --> 04:58.089
If I get bored of that drawing,
I want to buy another one of yours.

04:58.756 --> 05:00.008
I'm not the artist.

05:00.091 --> 05:01.092
Really?

05:01.592 --> 05:04.012
- Then I should just return that drawing.
- Wait.

05:07.140 --> 05:08.433
Please keep it a secret.

05:09.309 --> 05:11.769
Well, it's fun.

05:14.689 --> 05:17.734
This is my number.
Not many people know this number.

05:18.318 --> 05:21.070
Not many know my number either.
I don't have many friends.

05:23.531 --> 05:25.908
And just to be clear…

05:25.992 --> 05:28.786
Anyway, I'll give you a call later.

05:28.870 --> 05:31.205
ARTIST GO-OH

05:31.289 --> 05:33.833
…this is something that I do

05:33.916 --> 05:35.293
- Again?
- to all guys.

05:35.376 --> 05:38.671
- How long will this one last?
- There's no information about him.

05:39.339 --> 05:41.466
I wonder what your deal is.

05:42.925 --> 05:44.886
I'm just a romantic girl.

05:44.969 --> 05:46.637
Don't be ridiculous.

05:46.721 --> 05:49.307
Your interest in men lasts
no longer than two months.

05:49.390 --> 05:51.934
We all have our own ways.

05:53.061 --> 05:56.064
That's how it all began,

05:56.647 --> 05:58.941
but it turned out
that he was much more interesting

06:00.068 --> 06:01.694
than I had first thought.

06:06.741 --> 06:08.910
And that caused some problems.

06:11.913 --> 06:14.040
Mr. Choi, what are you up to?

06:14.123 --> 06:15.333
I'm preparing beansprouts.

06:15.416 --> 06:19.003
Gosh, it's scorching hot today.
What are you up to?

06:19.087 --> 06:21.339
I'm weeding.
It feels as if my head is on fire.

06:21.923 --> 06:23.841
I gave a terrific live performance today.

06:23.925 --> 06:26.052
Why aren't you watching?
What were you doing?

06:26.135 --> 06:29.514
I'm eating. I can pay to watch the rerun.

06:33.726 --> 06:37.355
Mr. Choi, I know it's late,
but I have a question.

06:38.689 --> 06:39.816
What are you doing right now?

06:39.899 --> 06:42.693
I thought he'd just be someone
I'd think of from time to time.

06:43.236 --> 06:44.821
To that person?

06:52.245 --> 06:53.287
Mr. Choi!

06:53.371 --> 06:54.622
So I wanted to find out

06:55.873 --> 06:58.459
if this will be
just another passing interest

06:58.543 --> 07:00.837
- or if it will end differently this time.
- Darn it.

07:02.380 --> 07:03.631
But I don't think

07:04.257 --> 07:06.425
it'll take too long to find out.

07:06.509 --> 07:13.516
EPISODE 10
HELLO, MY SOUL MATE

07:21.149 --> 07:22.358
What are you two doing?

07:31.909 --> 07:35.163
We started a new chapter
in our lives yesterday.

07:36.956 --> 07:39.584
We decided to be friends.

07:40.710 --> 07:41.627
It just happened.

07:43.129 --> 07:45.256
Are we shooting
a documentary or a comedy skit?

07:47.758 --> 07:51.053
Why are you here at this hour?
You didn't even call.

07:51.137 --> 07:52.430
You didn't pick up.

07:53.639 --> 07:57.852
Seeing you together
at this hour is very unexpected.

07:57.935 --> 08:00.730
Sure, I get that
you could take this the wrong way.

08:00.813 --> 08:02.440
- But it's definitely not--
- I'm not.

08:02.523 --> 08:04.984
You probably got tired of arguing
and reconciled.

08:05.067 --> 08:07.778
- Yes. Exactly that.
- Yes.

08:24.545 --> 08:26.589
- I'm going to sleep over.
- What?

08:27.215 --> 08:28.966
Hey. My house isn't an inn.

08:29.050 --> 08:30.885
Why does everyone do that?

08:31.552 --> 08:32.887
Did someone else sleep over?

08:34.055 --> 08:37.183
Eun-ho. That punk.

08:37.266 --> 08:38.184
Darn it.

08:44.524 --> 08:46.567
Are you guys going to just stand there?

08:46.651 --> 08:50.071
I was just about to leave since it's late.

08:50.154 --> 08:51.739
Wait. What about the chicken?

08:51.822 --> 08:54.450
- What? Are you sad to see me go?
- Not really.

08:54.534 --> 08:56.035
Late-night snacks are unhealthy.

08:56.118 --> 08:57.870
You're the one who ordered it.

08:57.954 --> 08:59.580
Bye. Have fun.

08:59.664 --> 09:01.749
Yeon-su, call a cab. It's dark.

09:01.832 --> 09:03.125
It's okay. I'll just walk.

09:03.209 --> 09:05.711
- I ordered some chicken--
- Hey. Just go already.

09:10.675 --> 09:12.552
You didn't need to kick me out.

09:12.635 --> 09:14.136
You can still catch a bus.

09:14.220 --> 09:16.597
Take the number four bus. Don't walk home.

09:41.664 --> 09:42.915
What is it?

09:45.126 --> 09:46.085
It's nothing.

09:51.966 --> 09:53.426
Finally, some peace.

09:55.136 --> 09:56.929
It'd be great
if someone else would leave too.

09:58.055 --> 09:59.849
I can hear you.

10:00.433 --> 10:02.059
- Did you eat?
- Yes.

10:03.269 --> 10:04.729
The chicken will be here soon.

10:07.231 --> 10:08.524
Did you order beer too?

10:11.485 --> 10:12.570
I did.

10:40.056 --> 10:41.349
You startled me.

10:41.432 --> 10:43.643
I almost had a heart attack.

10:43.726 --> 10:46.604
You brat. Do you know what time it is?

10:46.687 --> 10:49.607
What's the matter?
I always come home around this time.

10:49.690 --> 10:51.442
You didn't come home last night.

10:52.109 --> 10:54.654
I told you
I'd be sleeping over at my friend's.

10:54.737 --> 10:56.739
I'm no longer a kid, you know?

10:56.822 --> 10:58.991
Is that why you've been up until now?

10:59.075 --> 11:01.452
You don't have any friends.

11:01.535 --> 11:04.872
What? You shouldn't ridicule
your granddaughter like that.

11:04.955 --> 11:06.499
Where did you sleep? Where?

11:07.416 --> 11:11.420
- I slept at Sol-i's.
- I'm here, Yeon-su.

11:11.504 --> 11:12.880
Hi.

11:14.215 --> 11:16.050
Why are you here?

11:16.634 --> 11:18.511
You wench. How dare you lie?

11:18.594 --> 11:21.222
Tell me the truth. Where did you sleep?

11:21.305 --> 11:23.933
Grandma, I'll interrogate her.

11:24.016 --> 11:25.893
It's getting late. Go to bed.

11:26.394 --> 11:28.813
I'm certain she has a guy.

11:28.896 --> 11:30.564
- That's good news.
- Of course.

11:30.648 --> 11:33.734
- Then why did you slap her?
- Because I'm curious who it is.

11:33.818 --> 11:35.277
Find out about him.

11:35.361 --> 11:36.946
I can hear you guys.

11:37.988 --> 11:40.533
Really? Go in, Grandma.

11:42.159 --> 11:44.578
You have the right to remain silent.

11:49.750 --> 11:51.168
Why did you come to my house?

11:51.252 --> 11:53.295
I met your grandma in the alley.

11:53.879 --> 11:56.757
She thought you were sleeping over
at my place.

11:57.383 --> 11:59.468
You should have told me about it
before lying.

12:00.344 --> 12:01.720
I wasn't lying.

12:02.888 --> 12:04.473
How brazen of you.

12:05.057 --> 12:07.059
- What friend do you--
- Choi Ung.

12:07.143 --> 12:08.727
I slept over at his place.

12:08.811 --> 12:10.438
I knew it.

12:10.521 --> 12:12.982
He wants us to be friends.

12:13.065 --> 12:14.066
What?

12:14.650 --> 12:17.611
Friends. That's what he wants us to be.

12:19.196 --> 12:21.115
There you guys go again.

12:22.950 --> 12:25.536
Right? This is weird, right?

12:25.619 --> 12:27.913
That weirdo doesn't deserve
to be with someone like you.

12:27.997 --> 12:29.290
What's his deal?

12:33.043 --> 12:35.212
So? What did you say?

12:35.296 --> 12:36.255
Did you say yes?

12:38.007 --> 12:39.383
Yes, for now.

12:39.967 --> 12:41.427
For now?

12:42.845 --> 12:45.181
So? What's your plan?

12:46.182 --> 12:50.728
I'm going to find out
how he really feels while being friends.

12:51.645 --> 12:53.272
I'm going to make him admit it.

12:53.856 --> 12:55.858
Admit what? How he feels about you?

12:57.860 --> 13:01.447
Yeon-su, this isn't a crime movie.
It's romance.

13:02.198 --> 13:03.657
You're not after some criminal.

13:04.366 --> 13:05.993
You have a crush on him.

13:07.369 --> 13:08.454
A crush?

13:09.914 --> 13:12.750
That's not true. Don't be absurd.

13:13.501 --> 13:14.502
Then what is it?

13:16.170 --> 13:20.049
I just want to know what's on his mind.

13:21.217 --> 13:23.010
You're curious about his thoughts

13:23.719 --> 13:25.679
because you want him to feel the same way.

13:26.263 --> 13:28.599
That's what people call a crush.

13:31.602 --> 13:33.312
Go to bed. Stop thinking about him.

13:33.395 --> 13:35.898
I never said I was thinking about him.

13:35.981 --> 13:37.024
You have a crush.

13:37.107 --> 13:38.692
I've had plenty too.

13:39.276 --> 13:40.986
Ask me if you want to know anything.

13:41.070 --> 13:42.571
I don't have a crush on him.

13:44.198 --> 13:46.784
I didn't know you could be so devoted.

13:46.867 --> 13:49.662
- Do you still like him that much?
- It's not like that.

13:51.038 --> 13:52.790
What a terrible temper you have.

13:54.583 --> 13:56.502
You must like him a lot to be--

13:56.585 --> 13:58.087
That's not true.

14:09.431 --> 14:11.058
Ji-ung, hurry.

14:14.436 --> 14:15.646
- It's here?
- Yes.

14:45.426 --> 14:47.136
How many more shoots do we have?

14:48.053 --> 14:50.014
Three. We'll be done next week.

14:50.973 --> 14:53.559
How is it going?
I doubt it's going according to plan.

14:54.226 --> 14:58.647
If you're aware of that,
I'd like you to take more initiative.

14:58.731 --> 15:00.107
Stop running away.

15:11.744 --> 15:14.163
You've been giving me
that look often these days.

15:14.997 --> 15:16.749
Just say what's on your mind.

15:16.832 --> 15:19.835
If it's nonsense,
I'll filter it out myself.

15:21.378 --> 15:23.547
I did have a question.

15:25.215 --> 15:26.342
But never mind.

15:26.926 --> 15:28.052
Whatever.

15:28.135 --> 15:30.054
I'm just going to think however I want.

15:31.597 --> 15:34.975
Gosh. Now this is a creative way
of being annoying.

15:42.441 --> 15:45.152
What is it? Is something going on?

15:47.613 --> 15:49.031
I mean…

15:49.114 --> 15:52.451
You're not a drinker,
but you wanted to drink.

15:53.535 --> 15:55.204
And you haven't stayed over in ages.

15:56.080 --> 15:59.667
I just don't want to go home.

16:04.421 --> 16:05.422
What is it?

16:06.048 --> 16:08.092
Are you feeling butterflies
since I'm staying over?

16:08.801 --> 16:11.303
Are you drunk? Wash up and go to bed.

16:11.387 --> 16:12.388
By the way,

16:13.514 --> 16:16.141
hasn't it been years
since we had some alone time?

16:16.684 --> 16:18.602
Ung, should we sleep together?

16:20.354 --> 16:24.066
Gosh. This is why
I don't drink with lightweights.

16:24.149 --> 16:25.526
Are you going to bed already?

16:25.609 --> 16:27.903
I'm going to work a bit. You go ahead.

16:27.987 --> 16:29.989
But you've been drinking.

16:30.614 --> 16:31.448
Shut up.

16:31.532 --> 16:34.326
Don't go. I'm not sleepy.

16:36.829 --> 16:37.997
Hey.

16:39.123 --> 16:41.041
Go to sleep before I change my mind.

16:41.125 --> 16:43.419
I'm this close to kicking you out.
Good night.

17:34.636 --> 17:36.930
The camera is ready. Are you good?

17:38.474 --> 17:39.433
You're here early.

17:40.976 --> 17:43.103
- How's the scenery?
- Good.

17:43.187 --> 17:44.813
You can sit over there.

17:45.397 --> 17:48.400
- We'll begin whenever you're ready.
- Okay.

17:55.532 --> 17:57.201
You left it there on purpose, right?

17:57.284 --> 18:00.204
No, I really forgot about it.

18:01.371 --> 18:04.958
Your excuse for going back there is that
you left a pouch behind.

18:05.834 --> 18:07.252
You know it's pathetic, right?

18:07.336 --> 18:11.090
It's not an excuse. It's precious to me.

18:11.173 --> 18:12.966
Of course. Sure.

18:13.550 --> 18:16.178
I begged you to have lunch with me.

18:16.261 --> 18:20.474
But you just had to get that pouch
right now, so you declined.

18:21.266 --> 18:23.936
Why is that? Can I take a guess?

18:25.104 --> 18:27.147
You want to use that as an excuse

18:27.231 --> 18:30.692
to go back there
and have a lovely meal with Ung.

18:30.776 --> 18:32.486
Come on.

18:32.569 --> 18:33.737
Am I wrong?

18:36.323 --> 18:40.035
How did someone like Ung
get you under his thumb?

18:40.536 --> 18:42.371
I'm genuinely curious.

18:43.497 --> 18:46.458
Everyone! This girl fell
head over heels for her crush

18:46.542 --> 18:50.587
and has left me to starve all by myself!

18:50.671 --> 18:53.590
Can you stop saying
that I have a crush on him?

18:53.674 --> 18:54.883
I'll be off then.

18:56.885 --> 18:58.637
I'll have a tasty and blissful meal

18:58.720 --> 18:59.930
all by myself.

19:01.140 --> 19:02.391
Be happy, Yeon-su.

19:03.225 --> 19:04.560
Good luck, Yeon-su.

19:28.208 --> 19:30.460
Hello. I'm Choi Ung's friend, NJ…

19:32.045 --> 19:34.756
Can I use a fake name?
The company doesn't know I'm doing this.

19:34.840 --> 19:38.969
Can you blur my face? No, wait.
Will that make me look like a criminal?

19:40.053 --> 19:41.597
Let's just start filming.

19:42.264 --> 19:43.182
Hey.

19:48.312 --> 19:50.272
What do you want to know?

19:50.355 --> 19:52.065
Should I talk about Choi Ung?

19:55.986 --> 19:56.904
Your side dishes…

20:01.241 --> 20:03.327
- I remember now!
- My gosh!

20:04.786 --> 20:05.746
What are you doing here?

20:05.829 --> 20:08.707
You visited that bar over there
to steal their recipe, right?

20:08.790 --> 20:10.375
- What?
- Gosh.

20:10.459 --> 20:13.003
What are you doing here? Do you work here?

20:13.086 --> 20:14.922
Yes, I help out when they're busy.

20:15.714 --> 20:18.467
I knew you looked familiar.

20:19.259 --> 20:21.011
Are you doing market research again?

20:21.094 --> 20:22.387
No, I'm not.

20:24.181 --> 20:25.515
Are you close with the owner?

20:25.599 --> 20:27.726
What? Don't you know?

20:27.809 --> 20:29.186
- Know what?
- The name of this place.

20:30.354 --> 20:32.981
- It's With Ung.
- Yes. So?

20:35.067 --> 20:36.860
My gosh. No way.

20:36.944 --> 20:40.364
Unbelievable. How did you not know
when your own a shop nearby?

20:40.447 --> 20:42.741
Ji-ung's parents run this restaurant?

20:42.824 --> 20:44.618
I can't believe it.

20:44.701 --> 20:46.370
His family is wealthy.

20:46.453 --> 20:47.621
No wonder.

20:47.704 --> 20:51.333
Why didn't you even bother
to consider Ung?

20:51.416 --> 20:53.794
Come on. Ji-ung looks more--

20:53.877 --> 20:57.381
They're Ung's parents.
They own all the restaurants here.

20:58.757 --> 21:02.552
I do admit that Ung doesn't look like
he's from a wealthy family.

21:02.636 --> 21:04.972
But he is, and you better believe it.

21:05.055 --> 21:06.515
I got goosebumps.

21:07.975 --> 21:10.352
I finally found out one of his charms.

21:11.645 --> 21:14.314
Yeon-su, you're one cunning girl.

21:14.982 --> 21:17.818
- What about her?
- What? Nothing.

21:17.901 --> 21:19.444
Are you sure that's enough?

21:19.528 --> 21:21.989
- I have so much more to say.
- This is more than enough.

21:22.072 --> 21:25.492
- I didn't know they were filming today.
- Let me know if you need me again.

21:25.575 --> 21:27.369
Me neither. I was taken aback.

21:29.538 --> 21:30.580
Why are you here?

21:31.581 --> 21:34.584
Oh, I left something at your place.

21:34.668 --> 21:35.627
Mr. Choi.

21:36.712 --> 21:38.297
Were you watching the whole time?

21:38.380 --> 21:41.091
You shouldn't have.
It was supposed to be a surprise.

21:41.758 --> 21:43.760
Then why would you do it at my place?

21:43.844 --> 21:47.055
For convenience, of course.
We're going on a date today.

21:47.723 --> 21:50.642
I'm sorry? It's not a date.

21:50.726 --> 21:53.520
You must be Ms. Kook Yeon-su.
We've met once.

21:53.603 --> 21:54.980
Right.

21:55.063 --> 21:56.481
I enjoyed your documentary.

21:58.191 --> 22:00.944
- Mr. Kim, may I leave now?
- Sure.

22:01.028 --> 22:03.280
I'm famished.
You haven't eaten yet, right?

22:03.864 --> 22:04.823
- Let's go.
- Well…

22:04.906 --> 22:07.034
Hey, Ung!

22:07.117 --> 22:09.536
I left something at your place.

22:09.619 --> 22:11.246
I need to get it right now.

22:12.205 --> 22:13.832
Right now? What is it?

22:13.915 --> 22:16.376
It's something super precious to me.

22:16.460 --> 22:18.378
You can go inside and look for yourself.

22:18.462 --> 22:20.130
But it's your house.

22:20.213 --> 22:22.674
What's wrong? That's unlike you.

22:22.758 --> 22:24.176
But still…

22:24.968 --> 22:26.303
See you next time.

22:27.888 --> 22:29.014
Let's go.

22:29.639 --> 22:30.474
Okay.

22:31.099 --> 22:32.267
What should we have?

22:33.101 --> 22:34.519
Can I film your face right now?

22:35.562 --> 22:37.522
What face am I making?

22:38.774 --> 22:40.650
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

22:42.069 --> 22:44.112
Why was NJ being filmed?

22:44.196 --> 22:47.491
Beats me. She wanted
to be interviewed as Ung's friend.

22:47.574 --> 22:48.825
As his friend?

22:50.160 --> 22:52.662
He's suddenly made a new friend.

22:56.500 --> 22:58.460
Don't just stand there. Let's eat.

22:58.960 --> 23:01.213
We could've had something fancier.

23:01.296 --> 23:03.465
This was my treat
as a way of saying thank you.

23:03.548 --> 23:04.674
I like this place.

23:05.342 --> 23:07.219
I come here whenever I have free time.

23:08.178 --> 23:09.846
This must be a famous restaurant.

23:09.930 --> 23:12.474
- I have a great view from here.
- Of what?

23:12.557 --> 23:14.601
Of my building. Over there.

23:19.981 --> 23:22.901
- How much is that?
- When I first got it or now?

23:22.984 --> 23:24.861
How does it feel to own one?

23:25.779 --> 23:27.239
When I first got it or now?

23:28.323 --> 23:30.492
Gosh, you look very impressive right now.

23:31.243 --> 23:32.244
I know.

23:33.370 --> 23:36.206
How does it feel
to see the building I asked you to draw?

23:36.915 --> 23:39.417
Right. Well, you see…

23:41.128 --> 23:43.964
I don't think this is the right way
to go about drawing something.

23:44.047 --> 23:46.675
I'm afraid
it'll taint your reputation and--

23:46.758 --> 23:48.051
And?

23:49.427 --> 23:53.306
To be honest,
I'm not really motivated to draw.

23:55.559 --> 23:58.895
Oh, no. Even my building got rejected.

24:00.605 --> 24:02.315
That really hurt.

24:02.816 --> 24:04.943
That wasn't my intention.

24:05.026 --> 24:06.820
I'm just playing. I understand.

24:07.404 --> 24:09.281
Then let's forget about that favor.

24:12.993 --> 24:15.245
I told you. NJ comes here all the time.

24:15.328 --> 24:16.746
You're right.

24:16.830 --> 24:18.665
By the way, who's that guy?

24:18.748 --> 24:20.125
It's probably her manager.

24:20.208 --> 24:22.586
She's not as pretty as I thought.

24:22.669 --> 24:25.297
- She's too skinny.
- I agree.

24:25.964 --> 24:28.216
I think she recently had plastic surgery.

24:28.800 --> 24:29.926
Don't you think so?

24:30.010 --> 24:31.553
I'm certain. Let's take a photo.

24:31.636 --> 24:34.723
I'll take it. I have a better angle.

24:37.726 --> 24:39.853
I'm sorry,
but please don't take any photos.

24:41.146 --> 24:44.065
Well, we weren't taking a photo of you.

24:44.149 --> 24:46.151
We were taking a selfie.

24:46.735 --> 24:47.569
How ridiculous.

24:50.572 --> 24:53.408
This must happen a lot.
You seem to be used to it.

24:54.117 --> 24:57.162
I can never get used to it.
I just pretend I am.

24:59.289 --> 25:02.250
Soon, they'll post it online
and leave a comment.

25:03.335 --> 25:05.545
"I saw NJ today,
and she wasn't that pretty."

25:05.629 --> 25:07.297
"She didn't let me take a photo."

25:07.380 --> 25:09.132
"She had a nasty temper."

25:10.675 --> 25:12.469
They're strangers to me

25:12.969 --> 25:16.264
but they think they know me
and judge me so easily.

25:18.683 --> 25:20.018
Isn't that funny?

25:21.603 --> 25:24.231
I should've checked their phone.

25:24.314 --> 25:25.899
How rude of them.

25:25.982 --> 25:28.443
Why can't people understand me?

25:29.319 --> 25:31.446
And why are they so quick to judge?

25:38.870 --> 25:41.456
You don't need their understanding.

25:44.376 --> 25:46.586
There's no need for you to do that.

25:47.128 --> 25:50.006
Who cares? Let them see

25:50.090 --> 25:51.591
and believe what they want.

25:52.884 --> 25:55.178
It's fine as long as
you understand yourself.

25:56.304 --> 25:57.722
That's already hard enough.

26:02.978 --> 26:05.188
Do you know what your charm is?

26:05.272 --> 26:06.564
That was sudden.

26:06.648 --> 26:09.818
You're quite easygoing and humorous,

26:09.901 --> 26:12.153
so I can go on all day
about the most ridiculous things.

26:13.071 --> 26:15.407
- Is that a compliment?
- But you also have

26:15.490 --> 26:18.910
a serious and sincere side to you.

26:19.411 --> 26:21.371
So you tell me
what I need to hear at times.

26:23.665 --> 26:25.875
You're quite charming.
You have many layers.

26:28.628 --> 26:31.172
I'm not asking you out,
so why are you embarrassed?

26:32.090 --> 26:34.759
I'm not good with compliments.

26:35.677 --> 26:37.929
Look at that. You're also adorable.

26:38.930 --> 26:40.348
What should we do next?

26:40.432 --> 26:43.810
I haven't had a free day in ages.
What should we do?

26:43.893 --> 26:46.563
Let's see. First…

26:47.939 --> 26:49.274
Let's see…

26:49.357 --> 26:52.027
He's not the type
who easily befriends people.

26:52.110 --> 26:55.155
He's not naturally sociable.

26:55.238 --> 26:57.824
He's only interested in himself.

26:57.907 --> 27:01.202
He's just interested in her
because she's a celebrity.

27:01.828 --> 27:04.914
Since he's become famous,
he's enjoying himself.

27:05.415 --> 27:08.501
He shouldn't have revealed himself.
Why did he have to do that?

27:08.585 --> 27:11.046
Deep down, he sought attention.

27:11.129 --> 27:13.423
You're the one
who persuaded him to do that.

27:14.257 --> 27:15.800
Why did he have to be persuaded?

27:19.971 --> 27:21.056
What is it?

27:21.556 --> 27:24.184
You've been talking incessantly
about him for five blocks.

27:25.560 --> 27:28.772
What should we have?
Are you craving anything?

27:28.855 --> 27:31.024
That wasn't a smooth transition.
How suspicious.

27:31.107 --> 27:32.734
How about Korean food?

27:35.320 --> 27:37.530
- What? Hello.
- Mr. Choi.

27:37.614 --> 27:38.615
Hey, guys.

27:38.698 --> 27:41.409
What did you order so much?
It's double the usual.

27:41.493 --> 27:43.495
We've had a lot more customers lately.

27:44.120 --> 27:45.997
- Let me.
- It's fine.

27:46.081 --> 27:48.583
Mr. Choi, your back will give out.

27:48.666 --> 27:50.251
My back is just fine.

27:50.877 --> 27:54.589
Where is Ung? He hasn't been picking up.

27:54.672 --> 27:56.257
Should I call him over?

27:56.341 --> 27:58.343
- It's fine.
- Hey, Yeon-su.

27:58.426 --> 27:59.761
- Hello.
- Gosh.

27:59.844 --> 28:01.388
Why did you call Ji-ung for help?

28:01.471 --> 28:04.140
Gosh. Did I call you guys?

28:04.224 --> 28:05.725
We were just passing by.
It won't take long.

28:05.809 --> 28:07.811
Ji-ung, you're so wonderful.

28:08.520 --> 28:10.313
- Thank you.
- Let me help.

28:10.397 --> 28:11.481
- No.
- It's okay.

28:11.564 --> 28:12.857
- They're really heavy.
- Go.

28:12.941 --> 28:14.275
Did you eat?

28:14.359 --> 28:16.069
Not yet. We were about to eat.

28:16.152 --> 28:17.320
Then eat here.

28:18.279 --> 28:21.699
Goodness. Aren't you Ji-ung's mom?
It's been ages.

28:21.783 --> 28:24.285
I haven't seen you in so long.

28:24.369 --> 28:25.829
Goodness. Hello.

28:25.912 --> 28:28.206
I hadn't seen you in ages,
so I was worried.

28:28.289 --> 28:30.166
- Have you been well?
- Of course.

28:30.667 --> 28:32.460
You must have been grocery shopping.

28:32.544 --> 28:34.963
- Come inside if you haven't eaten yet.
- Come in.

28:35.046 --> 28:36.589
- Yeon-su.
- Yes?

28:36.673 --> 28:39.050
I'm sorry, but I don't think
I can eat with you.

28:39.134 --> 28:40.135
You should eat here.

28:42.554 --> 28:43.972
Wait.

28:45.098 --> 28:47.434
Goodness. Ji-ung, aren't you going to eat?

28:48.017 --> 28:48.852
All right.

28:49.519 --> 28:50.520
Goodbye.

28:50.603 --> 28:51.688
- Goodbye.
- Goodbye.

28:51.771 --> 28:54.065
- He should have just eaten here.
- Bye.

29:00.572 --> 29:02.198
Is there something you want to say?

29:04.826 --> 29:06.369
You should come home.

29:06.870 --> 29:08.872
Don't sleep elsewhere.

29:11.499 --> 29:13.418
Or do I need to leave?

29:14.002 --> 29:15.712
You're going to leave anyway.

29:22.510 --> 29:23.845
I have a favor.

29:25.805 --> 29:28.516
I really care about those people,

29:29.809 --> 29:32.353
so I don't want to show them
this side of me.

29:35.774 --> 29:37.192
Be your usual self.

29:39.110 --> 29:40.695
Ignore them and go on your way.

29:58.880 --> 30:01.466
This is a side of you I've never seen.

30:02.300 --> 30:06.054
- Sorry?
- I didn't expect you to know how to drive.

30:07.138 --> 30:10.308
- I like it.
- What? You startled me.

30:10.391 --> 30:11.851
You should choose your words carefully.

30:13.019 --> 30:14.187
Gosh.

30:14.270 --> 30:17.565
I see. That's not what I meant.

30:17.649 --> 30:19.275
I like driving.

30:20.443 --> 30:22.570
It's just that Eun-ho usually drives,

30:22.654 --> 30:26.241
and I rarely have to travel far.

30:27.450 --> 30:30.161
I wanted to have a blast today.

30:30.245 --> 30:32.705
I'm sorry we keep being chased around
because of me.

30:32.789 --> 30:35.250
Everyone seems to recognize you.

30:35.917 --> 30:37.919
What do you do when you're alone?

30:38.002 --> 30:40.630
Let's see…
Do I need to do be doing something?

30:40.713 --> 30:42.757
I enjoy doing nothing.

30:43.424 --> 30:44.884
Then what did you do yesterday?

30:46.594 --> 30:47.679
Well…

30:48.638 --> 30:49.764
I…

30:55.395 --> 30:57.480
I really don't want to have to do this

30:58.898 --> 31:00.233
but can I ask you something?

31:03.152 --> 31:04.946
What's going on between you and Ms. Kook?

31:08.616 --> 31:11.327
Do you mean in the past or now?

31:12.412 --> 31:13.496
Both.

31:15.456 --> 31:16.708
In the past,

31:17.792 --> 31:19.419
I really liked her.

31:20.587 --> 31:23.298
I didn't know I could be
that madly in love with someone.

31:26.968 --> 31:28.177
And now…

31:30.680 --> 31:32.056
we've decided to be friends.

31:33.516 --> 31:36.311
How does it feel
to love someone that much?

31:37.061 --> 31:38.146
I'm curious.

31:38.646 --> 31:42.775
How could you still talk like that
even when you've broken up?

31:45.403 --> 31:47.405
No. Never mind.

31:47.488 --> 31:49.782
Don't answer that.
I'm not curious anymore.

31:52.577 --> 31:54.537
I think we're here.

31:54.621 --> 31:56.956
Yes. Turn left over there.

32:12.180 --> 32:13.890
Thank you for dropping me off.

32:14.557 --> 32:16.184
- Goodbye.
- Goodbye.

32:16.267 --> 32:17.769
Wait.

32:17.852 --> 32:21.564
Don't take to heart what happened today.

32:22.190 --> 32:23.274
Rest up.

32:26.778 --> 32:27.737
Wait.

32:28.571 --> 32:31.574
It'd be a shame
to end my free day like this.

32:32.283 --> 32:35.328
- But there's nowhere we can--
- Do you want to come up?

32:55.431 --> 32:58.017
I'm not saying this because it bothers me.

32:58.101 --> 32:59.978
I'm just curious.

33:00.895 --> 33:03.064
What are they up to?

33:04.649 --> 33:06.192
Friends?

33:06.275 --> 33:08.820
It's not like they went to school together
or worked together.

33:08.903 --> 33:11.656
How can they be friends
when they share no memories?

33:15.785 --> 33:17.495
They can't still be together, right?

33:18.246 --> 33:20.164
If he had lunch outside,

33:20.248 --> 33:22.583
shouldn't he have dinner at home?

33:25.461 --> 33:27.255
Gosh, that's cold!

33:27.338 --> 33:29.382
- Gosh.
- You wench!

33:29.465 --> 33:30.550
Oh, dear.

33:30.633 --> 33:33.136
What are you trying to do to me?

33:33.219 --> 33:35.722
It's okay. It wasn't much.

33:35.805 --> 33:37.265
What do you mean?

33:37.348 --> 33:39.684
It feels as if I've been drenched.

33:39.767 --> 33:42.645
- You're not.
- Where has your mind wandered off to?

33:42.729 --> 33:44.856
It's because you were dozing off.

33:44.939 --> 33:47.191
Lift your head up. Okay?

33:51.654 --> 33:53.865
That really hurt my pride.

33:54.866 --> 33:56.242
Look, NJ.

33:57.410 --> 33:59.120
I think I should just go home.

34:00.913 --> 34:04.333
Why are you being so serious
about declining my offer?

34:04.917 --> 34:06.961
Because you had asked so politely.

34:07.045 --> 34:08.629
I wasn't polite at all.

34:08.713 --> 34:11.758
It was just a thought
that crossed my mind.

34:11.841 --> 34:15.261
You taking it so seriously
is making me feel embarrassed.

34:16.220 --> 34:17.388
Anyway, I'm sorry.

34:17.972 --> 34:20.058
I said that wasn't necessary.

34:20.725 --> 34:22.560
You know you're being ridiculous, right?

34:22.643 --> 34:24.562
Was I asking you to date me or something?

34:24.645 --> 34:28.858
I didn't want to say goodbye yet,
so I thought we could go up and chat.

34:28.941 --> 34:30.443
This is just how I am.

34:30.526 --> 34:32.361
It takes me time to warm up to people.

34:33.029 --> 34:33.905
I mean,

34:33.988 --> 34:36.866
it's already been a month.
How much slower do we need to go?

34:37.992 --> 34:40.328
He's going to stay
as my crush forever at this rate.

34:46.375 --> 34:47.543
Well…

34:48.920 --> 34:51.714
Having a crush doesn't sound too bad.

34:54.175 --> 34:57.136
I'll take my time.

34:58.012 --> 34:58.930
#NJ
1.81 MILLION POSTS

34:59.013 --> 35:01.390
APDLW_J
548 LIKES

35:01.474 --> 35:02.809
I saw the famous NJ.

35:02.892 --> 35:05.436
I asked her for a photo,
and she downright ignored me.

35:05.520 --> 35:06.896
She does have an awful temper.

35:06.979 --> 35:09.315
And is she really that pretty?
I beg to differ.

35:09.398 --> 35:11.192
So the rumors are true.

35:11.275 --> 35:12.860
- It's just a lousy photo.
- I saw her in person and…

35:12.944 --> 35:14.904
- It's all plastic surgery.
- Just stay home.

35:14.987 --> 35:16.197
She should know
that it's a part of her job.

35:21.953 --> 35:24.038
I left something at your place.

35:24.122 --> 35:26.124
I need to get it right now.

35:27.750 --> 35:30.253
It's something super precious to me.

35:47.770 --> 35:51.691
As a friend, I can ask him
what he's up to.

35:55.444 --> 35:58.656
You have a crush on him.

36:00.575 --> 36:01.993
That's not true.

36:02.076 --> 36:03.494
Are you almost done?

36:11.169 --> 36:14.881
This isn't…
I mean, I don't have a crush on him.

36:17.466 --> 36:18.301
What is this?

36:18.926 --> 36:22.013
What is all this?

36:23.264 --> 36:27.977
Who puts a zucchini this big
in their soup?

36:28.686 --> 36:30.313
What is the matter with you today?

36:31.189 --> 36:34.275
What in the world have you done?

37:09.227 --> 37:10.478
This is bad.

37:13.773 --> 37:15.233
I guess I was wrong.

37:18.986 --> 37:20.404
I do have a crush on him.

37:33.376 --> 37:34.585
Is this yours?

37:36.337 --> 37:38.047
Yes, it is.

37:41.050 --> 37:43.052
Was this
the super precious pouch of yours?

37:44.470 --> 37:46.013
Is this why you came?

37:48.140 --> 37:51.519
Well, you said
it was really precious to you.

37:54.313 --> 37:55.648
Is that it?

37:58.484 --> 37:59.777
So…

38:03.572 --> 38:04.949
I don't think…

38:07.243 --> 38:09.662
he's ever left my mind, not even once.

38:21.257 --> 38:22.591
You know what?

38:26.887 --> 38:28.097
I…

38:29.056 --> 38:30.391
I think…

38:30.474 --> 38:32.226
Who is that?

39:00.588 --> 39:02.715
I haven't seen you in years.

39:03.466 --> 39:05.009
So why did you suddenly show up?

39:06.218 --> 39:07.345
Grandma.

39:07.928 --> 39:09.805
You're the one who invited him inside.

39:09.889 --> 39:13.059
He said he hadn't eaten yet.
I should feed him.

39:14.852 --> 39:17.188
What are you doing? Eat up.

39:20.733 --> 39:23.611
So? Are you two dating again?

39:25.363 --> 39:29.158
Grandma. Just let him eat in peace.

39:29.241 --> 39:31.577
And we're just friends.

39:31.660 --> 39:33.162
Friends, my foot.

39:33.996 --> 39:35.748
Were you that desperate for a friend?

39:38.417 --> 39:40.252
Eat up, will you?

39:40.336 --> 39:41.379
Yes, ma'am.

39:41.462 --> 39:43.881
Look at him nibbling on the food.

39:43.964 --> 39:46.634
- Is it not good?
- It's delicious.

39:46.717 --> 39:49.136
Hey. Slow down.

39:49.678 --> 39:53.432
How desperate are you
to be friends with your ex?

39:54.183 --> 39:56.394
That boy is much better. Ji-ung.

39:57.353 --> 40:01.607
He's well-behaved and cute.

40:02.441 --> 40:06.070
On the other hand, look at him.
He's useless.

40:06.821 --> 40:08.447
Hey, I'm sorry.

40:09.115 --> 40:11.909
You know she likes to
bad-mouth people openly.

40:14.995 --> 40:17.039
Isn't anyone feeding you at home?

40:17.706 --> 40:19.542
You seem to be skinnier now.

40:20.876 --> 40:24.713
So tell me. Do you have a decent job?

40:25.589 --> 40:26.674
Well…

40:28.551 --> 40:30.970
Answer me, will you?

40:31.053 --> 40:34.098
I can see that you're still so bashful.

40:34.181 --> 40:37.435
Grandma, stop scolding him.

40:37.518 --> 40:40.604
Why are you being so harsh to him?

40:40.688 --> 40:43.065
How can I be nice
to someone who made you cry?

40:43.149 --> 40:45.276
I'd love to give him a good beating.

41:03.502 --> 41:06.380
Hey. This won't do. You should just go.

41:07.590 --> 41:10.176
It must be uncomfortable for you.
You should go.

41:10.259 --> 41:12.011
I apologize for her behavior.

41:13.345 --> 41:15.097
I should still eat.

41:31.155 --> 41:34.408
Make sure you have the side dishes too.

41:34.492 --> 41:35.743
Yes, ma'am.

41:49.465 --> 41:50.883
Gosh, look at this belly.

41:50.966 --> 41:52.718
It might burst.

41:53.302 --> 41:56.013
You shouldn't have eaten so much.
You had two bowls of rice.

41:56.096 --> 41:58.140
She gave me more soup if I had rice left

41:58.224 --> 42:00.267
and vice versa. I had no choice.

42:01.060 --> 42:02.811
This is the most I've eaten this year.

42:04.104 --> 42:05.648
She's still the same.

42:06.857 --> 42:08.692
She still scares me straight.

42:19.203 --> 42:20.287
Bye.

42:21.580 --> 42:22.623
Bye.

42:26.961 --> 42:27.920
Hey, Ung.

42:30.589 --> 42:31.590
I…

42:33.634 --> 42:34.635
Thanks.

42:36.428 --> 42:37.721
For what?

42:40.641 --> 42:41.809
Well…

42:44.061 --> 42:46.689
For bringing my pouch back.

42:49.108 --> 42:50.025
See?

42:51.485 --> 42:53.862
We can be friends.

43:16.719 --> 43:18.762
Grandma, let me do it.

43:19.597 --> 43:20.514
Okay.

43:22.474 --> 43:24.018
Did he leave?

43:24.602 --> 43:25.519
Yes.

43:27.396 --> 43:29.440
Gosh. He should have stayed longer.

43:29.982 --> 43:31.025
Why didn't he?

43:31.609 --> 43:33.819
How could he
when you were giving him an earful?

43:34.987 --> 43:36.447
I thought you wanted him gone.

43:37.364 --> 43:38.782
That's not true.

43:40.451 --> 43:42.411
But it's true
that he gave you a hard time.

43:45.205 --> 43:47.041
I didn't know you saw me crying.

43:47.124 --> 43:50.544
You were secretly crying for days on end.

43:50.628 --> 43:52.338
How could I have not noticed that?

43:53.589 --> 43:56.050
Thinking about it again
makes my blood boil.

43:56.133 --> 43:59.970
That scumbag. I should have been harsher.

44:31.377 --> 44:33.087
I was the one who dumped him.

44:35.839 --> 44:37.549
I abandoned him.

44:40.094 --> 44:41.220
What?

44:45.516 --> 44:47.267
It was my fault.

44:49.478 --> 44:50.854
I was selfish.

44:52.981 --> 44:54.274
Yeon-su.

44:55.818 --> 44:57.194
Grandma.

44:59.905 --> 45:01.740
I still have feelings for him.

45:05.411 --> 45:07.204
Although I abandoned him…

45:07.704 --> 45:09.331
I was the one who let him go,

45:10.499 --> 45:11.583
but I…

45:12.835 --> 45:14.878
I still like him.

45:18.006 --> 45:19.133
So…

45:20.092 --> 45:22.386
scold me instead.

45:24.805 --> 45:27.182
Tell me I was stupid and cruel.

45:28.183 --> 45:29.518
Scold me.

45:31.061 --> 45:33.480
Ask me why I did something I would regret.

45:36.066 --> 45:37.151
Please…

45:38.318 --> 45:39.361
Please scold me.

45:41.029 --> 45:42.156
Yeon-su…

45:44.241 --> 45:45.742
What should I do?

45:50.873 --> 45:53.000
I don't want to be friends with Ung.

45:54.668 --> 45:55.544
I can't.

45:58.088 --> 46:00.340
But I guess he can.

46:02.843 --> 46:04.761
What should I do?

46:17.191 --> 46:18.025
My poor puppy.

47:25.592 --> 47:28.428
Ms. Kook's eyes are still swollen.

47:30.097 --> 47:33.517
Speaking from experience, she probably
cried for at least five hours.

47:36.353 --> 47:39.314
I'm so exhausted.
I really am. I want to go home.

47:39.898 --> 47:42.442
It's such a lazy afternoon.

47:42.526 --> 47:45.279
Let's have some coffee
to help us stay awake.

47:45.362 --> 47:46.905
- Nice.
- Right?

47:46.989 --> 47:48.490
Let's do a draw
to see who will pay for it.

47:48.574 --> 47:49.825
- Yes?
- All right.

47:49.908 --> 47:51.743
Let's go. Get it ready.

47:55.372 --> 47:56.206
Ms. Kook.

48:01.086 --> 48:02.212
Did you see her eyes?

48:03.422 --> 48:04.548
What's wrong with her?

48:05.215 --> 48:06.842
Did you see her eyes?

48:09.678 --> 48:11.388
You look so different.

48:12.139 --> 48:13.724
A carp. She looks like a carp.

48:15.767 --> 48:17.686
Did you cry last night or something?

48:17.769 --> 48:20.188
If that's not it,
how could she look like this?

48:20.272 --> 48:21.440
I didn't cry.

48:23.525 --> 48:25.068
It's a sty.

48:26.153 --> 48:27.654
- What?
- A sty.

48:29.281 --> 48:31.491
It's a sty, sir.

48:36.788 --> 48:37.914
It's a sty.

48:38.582 --> 48:40.751
- It's a sty.
- I knew it.

48:40.834 --> 48:42.711
It's a sty. I told you so.

48:42.794 --> 48:44.504
Since she has a sty,

48:44.588 --> 48:46.840
let's all focus and do a good job.

48:46.923 --> 48:48.383
- Yes, sir.
- You can do it.

48:48.467 --> 48:49.968
- What about the draw?
- Skip it.

48:50.052 --> 48:52.304
- Yes, sir.
- It's a sty.

49:11.281 --> 49:16.244
Goodness. What brings you
all the way here to relax?

49:16.828 --> 49:19.206
No reason. It just felt weird
to be home alone.

49:19.289 --> 49:21.249
You were always alone in that house.

49:21.958 --> 49:25.337
So why did you even move out?
I told you to move back in.

49:25.420 --> 49:29.049
Gosh. I'm not coming back
no matter what you say to me.

49:30.133 --> 49:31.510
What if I ask you to?

49:32.094 --> 49:33.512
I could be a little swayed.

49:34.596 --> 49:36.932
Gosh, what a traitor.

49:37.015 --> 49:39.059
You don't deserve to sit on my bench. Go.

49:39.142 --> 49:40.769
No, you go.

49:40.852 --> 49:42.604
Fine. What a traitor.

49:44.106 --> 49:45.107
- Ung.
- Yes?

49:45.190 --> 49:47.901
Ask Ji-ung if he's having dinner outside.

49:47.984 --> 49:50.570
If not, tell him to come over
since I've made him a delicious meal.

49:51.154 --> 49:53.240
We spoke earlier,
and he'll be working late.

49:53.323 --> 49:56.118
He always pretends
to be busy when he's not.

49:56.201 --> 49:57.994
Really? That's not good.

49:58.078 --> 50:00.080
He needs to have a proper meal today.

50:00.163 --> 50:04.042
Then I'll pack his dinner.
Can you drop it off?

50:04.626 --> 50:08.213
Come on.
Just call a delivery man. I'll pay for it.

50:08.296 --> 50:11.383
Don't be ridiculous.
You're not doing anything anyway.

50:11.466 --> 50:13.343
Gosh, I can't be bothered.

50:13.427 --> 50:15.053
Tell him to come late and eat.

50:15.137 --> 50:17.764
Not today. Hurry and get ready.

50:18.974 --> 50:20.308
Gosh.

50:30.652 --> 50:32.487
You should go home tonight.

50:32.571 --> 50:34.614
I've left the house.

50:40.787 --> 50:42.748
Ji-ung, are you going to the editing room?

50:45.500 --> 50:46.334
Ji-ung.

50:48.044 --> 50:49.921
- Yes?
- Are you going to the editing room?

50:51.506 --> 50:52.674
Yes.

50:53.425 --> 50:55.761
What? Right. Can you leave this there?

50:55.844 --> 50:58.472
I'm going to go home, wash up,
and change my clothes.

50:58.555 --> 51:00.307
Did you spend the night here again?

51:00.390 --> 51:01.516
Yes.

51:02.601 --> 51:04.728
Please do that for me. I'll be back.

52:29.771 --> 52:31.106
Look who's here!

52:31.189 --> 52:33.900
- Ung!
- Hello, Mr. Park.

52:33.984 --> 52:36.236
Gosh. Look at you.

52:36.319 --> 52:38.989
You haven't changed one bit!

52:39.072 --> 52:41.825
I saw the footage,
and you really hadn't changed.

52:41.908 --> 52:43.535
You still look like you're in high school.

52:43.618 --> 52:46.705
You still look like
you're in your thirties.

52:47.372 --> 52:48.582
I am in my thirties.

52:50.709 --> 52:52.377
Exactly. You look like it.

52:52.460 --> 52:53.670
I see.

52:55.213 --> 52:57.507
Why are you here?
Are you here to see Ji-ung?

52:57.591 --> 52:59.009
Where is he?

52:59.092 --> 53:01.887
He and Chae-ran are practically living
in the editing room.

53:01.970 --> 53:03.930
- Follow me. I'll take you there.
- Okay.

53:04.014 --> 53:07.225
Gosh. I see that you've really made it.

53:07.309 --> 53:09.853
Even though you had
the lowest grades in school,

53:09.936 --> 53:13.106
I saw your potential
when I saw your drawings.

53:13.189 --> 53:15.901
- Gosh. How are your parents doing?
- They're doing well.

53:16.818 --> 53:19.237
Chae-ran. Where's Ji-ung?

53:19.321 --> 53:22.824
He just left to stop by his house.

53:22.908 --> 53:24.576
I see. Is he coming back?

53:25.160 --> 53:27.746
He said it won't take long.
He'll be back soon.

53:28.747 --> 53:29.581
Is that so?

53:29.664 --> 53:32.918
Ung, wait here. Ji-ung will be back soon.

53:33.001 --> 53:34.377
- Okay.
- Good.

53:34.461 --> 53:36.296
Chae-ran, come out for a minute.

53:36.379 --> 53:37.839
- I have something to say.
- Okay.

53:42.761 --> 53:44.471
Gosh.

53:47.057 --> 53:48.266
What?

53:55.023 --> 53:56.608
What do I need to press?

54:10.038 --> 54:12.791
Exactly how slow do I need to be?

54:12.874 --> 54:14.334
MR. CHOI UNG

54:15.251 --> 54:17.128
Should I call or not?

54:24.552 --> 54:25.971
Hello?

54:27.305 --> 54:28.348
What?

54:30.934 --> 54:32.227
Okay. I'll check.

54:36.982 --> 54:38.775
Please pick up this time around.

54:41.069 --> 54:45.198
Gosh. I can't believe
my eyes are still red.

54:46.491 --> 54:48.410
I'm never going to cry again.

54:58.086 --> 55:00.547
- What is it?
- Are you still working?

55:01.464 --> 55:03.550
No, I clocked out on the dot.

55:03.633 --> 55:05.927
Well… Are you okay?

55:06.469 --> 55:07.470
What do you mean?

55:08.096 --> 55:09.639
Did you not read the news?

55:10.974 --> 55:12.017
About what?

55:12.100 --> 55:15.270
It's about NJ's dating rumor.

55:15.353 --> 55:16.688
Ji-ung?

55:16.771 --> 55:17.981
The thing is…

55:18.064 --> 55:19.649
- Hold on.
- Ung--

55:20.442 --> 55:22.152
It is you.

55:23.278 --> 55:24.738
Are you headed home?

55:27.032 --> 55:28.450
You must have left work early.

55:33.955 --> 55:37.250
I'm in a hurry,
so I should get going. Goodbye.

55:45.425 --> 55:48.428
Did something happen?

55:52.307 --> 55:53.349
Yeon-su.

55:55.143 --> 55:56.019
Yes?

55:57.228 --> 55:58.438
Today's my birthday.

55:59.814 --> 56:01.858
Oh, really?

56:02.484 --> 56:05.862
Happy birthday. Had I known sooner,
I would have treated you to a meal.

56:08.031 --> 56:10.492
My mom came by
and prepared a birthday meal.

56:11.910 --> 56:13.703
She's the woman I saw before, right?

56:14.954 --> 56:17.749
That was my first time seeing her.
She's really beautiful.

56:21.044 --> 56:22.462
She still doesn't know…

56:25.799 --> 56:28.134
that I'm allergic to peaches.

56:33.973 --> 56:35.141
One time…

56:37.769 --> 56:39.187
I almost died…

56:42.065 --> 56:44.567
in front of her after eating a peach.

56:46.194 --> 56:48.279
But I guess she still doesn't know.

56:50.115 --> 56:52.492
Hey. Ji-ung…

56:59.582 --> 57:01.417
Are you okay?

57:04.045 --> 57:05.922
Or is it that she doesn't want to know?

57:33.867 --> 57:35.994
CURRENT AFFAIRS AND CULTURE
KIM JI-UNG

57:40.999 --> 57:44.627
EPILOGUE
NOVEMBER, 2010

57:54.429 --> 57:56.055
Why are you standing here?

57:57.932 --> 58:00.059
Can I sleep over at your house today?

58:01.102 --> 58:02.187
Sure, you can.

58:23.374 --> 58:25.084
Isn't it much warmer now?

58:29.297 --> 58:30.715
How can he do that?

58:31.424 --> 58:33.092
- Unbelievable.
- I know, right?

58:34.219 --> 58:36.346
- Are you sleepy?
- No.

58:49.192 --> 58:52.362
THE PREVIOUS NIGHT

58:54.447 --> 58:55.865
Shouldn't you be working?

58:56.449 --> 58:57.951
Gosh.

59:02.539 --> 59:03.790
Tell me.

59:04.624 --> 59:05.625
About what?

59:05.708 --> 59:07.752
I'm all ears, so spill.

59:13.967 --> 59:14.968
My mom came by.

59:22.976 --> 59:24.978
She came unannounced again.

59:28.231 --> 59:31.818
Judging by the size of her suitcase,
I think she'll be here for a week.

59:33.903 --> 59:35.947
She'll act as if
she'll be staying with me.

59:37.657 --> 59:39.033
Then she'll vanish again.

59:41.536 --> 59:43.746
Gosh. How many times has she done this?

59:45.999 --> 59:48.459
She even made breakfast this morning.

59:48.543 --> 59:49.836
I can't believe her.

59:55.550 --> 01:00:02.557
HELLO, MY SOUL MATE

01:00:25.413 --> 01:00:27.999
She's pretty, but she's not Ung's type.

01:00:28.625 --> 01:00:31.794
What's the probability of your ex
ending up in a scandal with a celebrity

01:00:31.878 --> 01:00:33.171
in your lifetime?

01:00:33.755 --> 01:00:35.256
Someone told me

01:00:35.340 --> 01:00:37.842
that everything I shoot
is full of emotions.

01:00:38.926 --> 01:00:42.096
About how you wanted us to be friends…

01:00:42.180 --> 01:00:44.015
I don't think I can do that.

01:00:44.098 --> 01:00:45.475
You're drunk.

01:00:45.558 --> 01:00:49.312
I don't think I can ever face
something I can't handle again.

01:00:51.147 --> 01:00:52.190
The two of you…

01:00:53.066 --> 01:00:54.942
As you've read in the articles,

01:00:55.026 --> 01:00:57.236
we're seeing each other.

01:00:59.113 --> 01:01:04.118
Subtitle translation by: Soo-ji Kim
